  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim to support CETUD in finalizing the Resettlement Action Plan to be able to unlock the financing from donor banks to commence the BRT infrastructural work. Overall objective is to enable an effective, economically viable and sustainable transport system to meet the growing demand, also creating a safe transport system which is safe for exposed groups (eg. women).</narrative>
